Subject: [PATCH] gta4xl-common: Set legacy gralloc flag

Gralloc here is allocator/mapper 2.x (gralloc3), there is no gralloc 4
or newer.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I370dd20cdf35400f4dce9e82ad55368fdaaf9ec4
---
 common.mk | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/common.mk b/common.mk
index 79cb436..3cf8f6e 100644
--- a/common.mk
+++ b/common.mk
@@ -84,6 +84,8 @@ PRODUCT_PACKAGES += \
     android.hardware.composer.hwc3-service.slsi \
     gralloc.universal9611
 
+$(call soong_config_set_bool,libui,legacy_gralloc,true)
+
 # Dynamic Partitions
 PRODUCT_USE_DYNAMIC_PARTITIONS := true
 
